1
00:00:23,712 --> 00:00:28,451
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

2
00:00:28,451 --> 00:00:32,163
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

3
00:00:32,387 --> 00:00:34,632
♪A cold face♪

4
00:00:34,979 --> 00:00:37,686
♪With two lines of tears♪

5
00:00:38,565 --> 00:00:43,093
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

6
00:00:43,093 --> 00:00:46,725
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

7
00:00:47,203 --> 00:00:50,691
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

8
00:00:52,835 --> 00:00:55,331
♪The storyteller says♪

9
00:00:55,331 --> 00:00:59,971
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

10
00:01:00,359 --> 00:01:02,019
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

11
00:01:02,019 --> 00:01:07,971
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

12
00:01:08,163 --> 00:01:11,851
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

13
00:01:11,851 --> 00:01:15,422
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

14
00:01:15,587 --> 00:01:22,531
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

15
00:01:22,979 --> 00:01:26,600
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

16
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:30,284
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

17
00:01:30,371 --> 00:01:35,299
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

18
00:01:35,299 --> 00:01:39,459
♪How can I bear to let go♪

19
00:01:43,203 --> 00:01:46,755
=Whispers of Southern Song=

20
00:01:47,299 --> 00:01:49,955
=Episode 18=

21
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:52,560
Governor, something's wrong.

22
00:01:52,799 --> 00:01:53,719
Special Ops reported

23
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:56,319
the Xiaosheng Society's men
have taken Mr. Rong.

24
00:01:58,688 --> 00:01:59,968
(Xiaosheng Society took Rong Xiaonan,
Special Ops)

25
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:03,680
I didn't kill him.

26
00:02:03,879 --> 00:02:05,760
You'an, you wouldn't kill me.

27
00:02:07,599 --> 00:02:08,400
Governor.

28
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:13,639
We can move now.

29
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:15,639
Yes.

30
00:02:19,719 --> 00:02:20,520
Governor.

31
00:02:21,159 --> 00:02:22,520
Are the troops all assembled?

32
00:02:22,759 --> 00:02:25,000
The city garrison
received orders early this morning

33
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:25,919
and were redeployed.

34
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:27,808
They said it was your handwritten order.

35
00:02:27,879 --> 00:02:30,680
Now the communication lines are down.

36
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:31,741
We can't get through.

37
00:02:32,199 --> 00:02:33,000
One more thing.

38
00:02:33,199 --> 00:02:34,360
Backyard guards reported...

39
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:35,960
Xu Fan is missing, right?

40
00:02:37,879 --> 00:02:40,280
He must have had someone
help him escape over the wall.

41
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:42,520
And, about the forged handwritten order,

42
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:43,800
I've had it looked into.

43
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:45,479
No need for that.

44
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:47,840
What a clever scheme.

45
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:51,840
I was too soft-hearted
towards that cunning one.

46
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:53,319
What about the Xiaosheng Society?

47
00:02:53,599 --> 00:02:54,719
The Special Ops reports

48
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:57,360
they've recently hired
a large number of thugs

49
00:02:58,400 --> 00:02:59,475
and are heavily guarded.

50
00:02:59,759 --> 00:03:01,677
Order the Xishan battalion
troops into the city.

51
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:04,879
You go personally.
When you're there, signal with a shot.

52
00:03:05,159 --> 00:03:06,400
We'll strike from both sides.

53
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:07,120
Yes.

54
00:03:18,599 --> 00:03:19,879
I know you're worried about him.

55
00:03:20,159 --> 00:03:21,520
I won't abandon him.

56
00:03:21,719 --> 00:03:23,560
He's not the only one I'm worried about.

57
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:25,319
Take me with you.

58
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:27,280
I don't want to lose anyone important.

59
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:29,319
Not a single one.

60
00:03:32,719 --> 00:03:35,520
Alright. Come with me.

61
00:03:41,039 --> 00:03:41,840
Come on.

62
00:03:44,199 --> 00:03:45,080
Where are we?

63
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:47,599
Aren't we going
to the Xiaosheng Society?

64
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:51,719
Before we go, there's something
I need to ask of you.

65
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,479
In those war-torn years,

66
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:02,199
my mother and I wandered everywhere.

67
00:04:03,439 --> 00:04:06,240
We always thought if we outran the war,

68
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:07,599
we could survive.

69
00:04:09,439 --> 00:04:10,240
I never expected

70
00:04:11,439 --> 00:04:15,560
that in the end, she died in the war
because of a bag of millet.

71
00:04:16,879 --> 00:04:20,439
I've always wanted
to put up a memorial grave for her.

72
00:04:21,399 --> 00:04:24,720
After thinking it over,
I finally thought of this place.

73
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:27,639
When it's Qingming,

74
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:32,160
please tend to the place
and pay respects for me.

75
00:04:32,759 --> 00:04:33,963
The ceremony wasn't completed,

76
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:35,480
but

77
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:38,680
we're still family.

78
00:04:39,519 --> 00:04:41,720
If so, we should come
and pay respects together.

79
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:44,560
Don't say such unlucky things.

80
00:05:07,879 --> 00:05:10,199
Let's make this place
our home from now on.

81
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:22,360
I didn't expect it to still be here.

82
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:33,720
How can it be?

83
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:37,079
Isn't this Mr. Rong's token?

84
00:05:37,079 --> 00:05:38,120
Why is it here?

85
00:05:39,959 --> 00:05:40,839
What did you say?

86
00:05:41,519 --> 00:05:42,800
This is Rong Xiaonan's thing?

87
00:05:43,199 --> 00:05:44,000
Yes.

88
00:05:45,480 --> 00:05:47,160
It's the token between him
and his brother.

89
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:51,120
He once asked me to find
the person with the same token.

90
00:05:51,399 --> 00:05:53,399
But I searched all over Fengcheng

91
00:05:53,399 --> 00:05:54,680
and never found that person.

92
00:05:56,079 --> 00:05:57,040
Zhuzi.

93
00:05:58,160 --> 00:06:00,639
I once had a brother.
And we only had each other.

94
00:06:01,279 --> 00:06:02,480
I've searched for years

95
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:05,319
and never found a trace of him.

96
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:07,160
Stop!

97
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:07,660
Over here!

98
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:09,360
Run!

99
00:06:10,759 --> 00:06:11,560
Brother!

100
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:12,279
Run!

101
00:06:12,439 --> 00:06:13,464
Take him to the barracks!

102
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:14,100
Move!

103
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:17,079
Brother!

104
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:23,279
Did he tell you

105
00:06:23,639 --> 00:06:25,319
anything about someone named Shitou?

106
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:26,360
He...

107
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:30,480
Before going undercover
to assassinate, he thought he'd die.

108
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:32,560
So he left me a farewell letter.

109
00:06:32,879 --> 00:06:35,920
He asked me
to make sure I find his brother

110
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:37,839
and see if he's still alive.

111
00:06:43,079 --> 00:06:45,519
Y-You are Mr. Rong's brother?

112
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:48,759
Let's go rescue him together.

113
00:06:49,399 --> 00:06:50,879
We three will come back together.

114
00:06:52,160 --> 00:06:52,959
Alright.

115
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:57,079
But the Xiaosheng Society
is not what it used to be.

116
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:58,959
To rescue Zhuzi,

117
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:01,160
you need to mobilize a troop for me.

118
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:03,600
I'll go and scout the layout first.

119
00:07:04,439 --> 00:07:05,240
Alright.

120
00:07:16,759 --> 00:07:17,560
Don't worry.

121
00:07:17,759 --> 00:07:18,800
I've arranged everything.

122
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:20,560
They will follow your orders.

123
00:07:20,839 --> 00:07:22,473
See you at the Xiaosheng Society's gate.

124
00:07:22,839 --> 00:07:23,639
Alright.

125
00:07:45,079 --> 00:07:45,920
What's going on?

126
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:47,360
Sorry, Madam.

127
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:49,759
These are the Governor's orders.

128
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:52,439
He told me to drive
until we run out of petrol,

129
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:53,399
as far as possible.

130
00:07:57,959 --> 00:07:59,160
What do they take me for?

131
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:01,399
Someone who's only there for the good?

132
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,040
Open the door!

133
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:06,600
Open the door!

134
00:08:15,079 --> 00:08:16,959
Madam, stop running.

135
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:18,519
We're already out of the city.

136
00:08:18,839 --> 00:08:20,480
You will not run back tonight.

137
00:08:21,319 --> 00:08:22,879
(You really are brothers,)

138
00:08:23,199 --> 00:08:26,160
(telling the same lie
at the worst possible moment.)

139
00:08:26,160 --> 00:08:26,959
No.

140
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:28,759
I must go back.

141
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:34,720
I know you're all tough.

142
00:08:35,399 --> 00:08:38,720
Today, I'll let you taste
the power of my foreign drug.

143
00:08:39,759 --> 00:08:44,240
It can amplify nerve pain
a hundred times.

144
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:49,600
Rest assured,

145
00:08:50,679 --> 00:08:53,679
I've tested it
on those women in Fengcheng.

146
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:55,960
Their screams were piercing

147
00:08:56,720 --> 00:08:57,559
and pleasant.

148
00:08:58,399 --> 00:08:59,799
The effect was remarkable.

149
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:01,279
You'll die a horrible death!

150
00:09:06,519 --> 00:09:09,720
I heard you sing opera well.

151
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:15,039
This drug can damage your nerves.

152
00:09:16,240 --> 00:09:20,519
I'm afraid you'll never be able
to sing opera again.

153
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:32,320
Is that all you've got?

154
00:09:33,039 --> 00:09:33,840
You're useless.

155
00:09:34,159 --> 00:09:35,000
Coward!

156
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:35,919
Boss.

157
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:45,559
That scoundrel Xu Fan was right.

158
00:09:46,039 --> 00:09:50,559
Xu You'an indeed recklessly
rushed over to save you.

159
00:09:59,759 --> 00:10:01,679
Where is Rong Xiaonan?

160
00:10:16,679 --> 00:10:21,039
You didn't really think
Xu Fan had gone crazy, did you?

161
00:10:21,759 --> 00:10:22,840
You know what?

162
00:10:23,639 --> 00:10:24,960
He's not crazy

163
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:27,320
and wants to hit two birds
with one stone,

164
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:29,399
so we both win.

165
00:10:30,320 --> 00:10:31,679
Take a guess.

166
00:10:32,240 --> 00:10:34,639
Will the brave and resourceful Xu You'an

167
00:10:36,279 --> 00:10:39,200
be able to walk
out of this door alive today?

168
00:10:40,279 --> 00:10:43,360
That scoundrel Xu Fan
was faking his madness?

169
00:10:43,679 --> 00:10:46,879
Let me go! I will kill him
with my own hands!

170
00:10:46,879 --> 00:10:47,720
I'll kill him!

171
00:10:48,519 --> 00:10:49,840
I'll see him ruined

172
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:51,240
beyond all recovery!

173
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:03,200
Tell Du Xiaolin to bring him out!

174
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:05,080
Buddies! Hack him to death!

175
00:11:11,552 --> 00:11:14,528
(Xiaosheng Society)

176
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:24,879
What exactly do you want?

177
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:28,120
The Jade Buddha Head?
But why involve Xu You'an?

178
00:11:34,600 --> 00:11:37,440
It's true that I want the Buddha Head.

179
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:41,679
But Xu Fan wants Xu You'an's life.

180
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:16,919
Go tell them
to cripple limbs of Xu You'an

181
00:12:17,519 --> 00:12:19,919
and then torture him brutally.

182
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:24,879
I want to repay the humiliation
I suffered a hundredfold.

183
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:29,279
What do you want?
I can give you everything.

184
00:12:29,879 --> 00:12:31,951
I can take you
to find the kingfisher phoenix crown.

185
00:12:32,720 --> 00:12:33,799
Consider it my sincerity.

186
00:12:35,519 --> 00:12:40,559
But I want Xu You'an to leave alive.

187
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:45,000
Fine.

188
00:12:48,679 --> 00:12:52,919
Then tidy up your clothes

189
00:12:53,159 --> 00:12:56,159
and wipe the sweat
off your face and neck.

190
00:12:56,519 --> 00:12:58,360
I want Xu You'an to see

191
00:12:58,360 --> 00:13:00,360
how I treat my guests.

192
00:13:06,039 --> 00:13:08,000
(Now I can only use cultural relics
to buy time)

193
00:13:08,639 --> 00:13:10,360
(to protect Xu You'an and Chun'er.)

194
00:13:11,279 --> 00:13:13,519
(The Xiaosheng Society
wants those two so badly.)

195
00:13:14,240 --> 00:13:17,639
(They are probably more
than just cultural relics.)

196
00:13:18,279 --> 00:13:20,120
(Whatever secret lies behind all this,)

197
00:13:20,759 --> 00:13:22,159
(they mustn't get them.)

198
00:13:22,960 --> 00:13:24,279
(Xu Fan must die.)

199
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:27,519
(And the Xiaosheng Society
must be destroyed.)

200
00:13:49,376 --> 00:13:50,656
♪As if it were fate♪

201
00:13:50,656 --> 00:13:52,013
♪Deliberately playing tricks♪

202
00:13:52,575 --> 00:13:55,812
♪We miss each other♪

203
00:13:57,056 --> 00:13:58,624
♪Creating a turbulent drama♪

204
00:13:58,624 --> 00:14:01,024
♪And a bizarre♪

205
00:14:01,024 --> 00:14:03,826
♪Anonymous legend♪

206
00:14:04,356 --> 00:14:06,368
♪The plot twists and turns♪

207
00:14:06,516 --> 00:14:08,256
♪Play out over and over again♪

208
00:14:08,256 --> 00:14:11,320
♪Waiting to be discarded♪

209
00:14:11,901 --> 00:14:13,600
♪And you are like a moth to the flame♪

210
00:14:13,600 --> 00:14:14,592
♪Refuse to submit♪

211
00:14:14,592 --> 00:14:17,792
♪I can't bear to blame you♪

212
00:14:19,456 --> 00:14:22,368
♪There are always too many♪

213
00:14:22,368 --> 00:14:24,256
♪Helpless situations♪

214
00:14:24,256 --> 00:14:26,880
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

215
00:14:28,011 --> 00:14:29,971
♪Even if I have questions♪

216
00:14:29,971 --> 00:14:31,971
♪I harbor desires♪

217
00:14:31,971 --> 00:14:34,848
♪Nowhere to find answers♪

218
00:14:35,199 --> 00:14:36,832
♪People come and go♪

219
00:14:36,832 --> 00:14:39,648
♪I'm still all alone♪

220
00:14:39,648 --> 00:14:42,376
♪Wandering around♪

221
00:14:42,624 --> 00:14:45,477
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

222
00:14:45,477 --> 00:14:49,938
♪Go through the entanglement♪

223
00:14:50,304 --> 00:14:52,032
♪If longing♪

224
00:14:52,032 --> 00:14:55,191
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

225
00:14:55,191 --> 00:14:57,946
♪How can I be at ease♪

226
00:14:58,048 --> 00:15:00,362
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

227
00:15:00,480 --> 00:15:02,336
♪And travelled around the world♪

228
00:15:02,432 --> 00:15:05,520
♪Scars all over me♪

229
00:15:05,792 --> 00:15:08,704
♪If longing never fades♪

230
00:15:08,704 --> 00:15:10,153
♪Burns still hot♪

231
00:15:10,153 --> 00:15:13,232
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

232
00:15:13,504 --> 00:15:15,361
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

233
00:15:15,424 --> 00:15:16,608
♪In the next life♪

234
00:15:16,608 --> 00:15:21,088
♪Entangle with you again♪
